# 计分板的目标/队伍：**重复添加要报错**，名字和显示名有长度上限。
#
# 1.12.2 的 `CommandScoreboard` 按这个顺序查：
#   1. 目标名已经存在 -> `An objective with the name 'X' already exists`
#   2. 名字超过 16 个字符 -> `The name 'X' is too long for an objective, it
#      be at most 16 characters long`
#   3. 显示名超过 32 个字符 -> `The display name 'X' is too long ...`
# 而且**查完才建**——查不过就根本不会建。
#
# 队伍那边同理（`A team with the name 'X' already exists`），而目标类型的
# 名字不认识时是 `Invalid objective criteria type 'X'`。
#
# 另外 `/execute … detect` 先看**区块加载了没有**（`World.isLoaded`），
# 没加载就报 `Failed to execute 'detect' as <实体>`——和方块对不上是同一条。
#
# bot: Steve

--- console ---
say R01
scoreboard objectives add t dummy
say R02
scoreboard objectives add t dummy
say R03
scoreboard objectives add abcdefghijklmnopq dummy
say R04
scoreboard objectives add t2 dummy 12345678901234567890123456789012
say R05
scoreboard objectives add t2b dummy 123456789012345678901234567890123
say R06
scoreboard teams add tt2 123456789012345678901234567890123
say R07
scoreboard objectives add t3 notacriteria
say R08
scoreboard teams add tt
say R09
scoreboard teams add tt
say R10
execute Steve 900 4 900 detect 900 4 900 stone 0 say hi
say R11
execute Steve ~ ~ ~ detect ~ ~ ~ stone 0 say hi
say R12
